# qcbridge-adobe.md, dualview.md, annotations.md — a live feed (needs the test producer: see run-live.sh)
size 1440 900
open MEDIA/Color Bars 1080p.mov
wait 1.0
live qcbae://probe
wait 3.0
shot qcv3_051
# a stream's notes live beside the project: save it first (an unsaved project turns the tile into Save project…, a native panel)
saveproject DEMO/Live Review.qcvproj
menu LeftRail
menu Notes
wait 1.2
# qcv3_038: the Export notes menu on a stream item (it needs a note)
click 72 644
wait 3.5
click 72 800
wait 0.8
shot qcv3_038 0 500 560 400
click 700 200
wait 0.3
menu Notes
bsource MEDIA/Test Pattern A.mov
wait 1.5
dual sbs
wait 2.0
shot qcv3_045
shot qcv3_052
quit
